# Rul v0.6 Standard Library: Region-Backed Multi-Instance Growable Vec (I64 & U8)
# Layout in vec.meta (i64:plain, 4096 slots):
#   Header [0..4): [0]=num_vecs, [1]=i64_arena_used, [2]=u8_arena_used, [3]=reserved
#   Descriptor id at base = 4 + (id << 2): [kind(0=None,1=I64,2=U8), offset, len, cap]
# Supports >= 2 concurrent logical Vec instances with exponential growth and bulk append.
